---
title: "Past Web Projects | Roman Waters"
metaDescription: "View my web design and development portfolio featuring WordPress, WooCommerce and Shopify projects for Brighton businesses and UK clients."
layout: "layouts/base.njk"
---
<section>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8 mt-24 sm:mt-32 lg:mt-16 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl lg:mx-0">
      <p class="text-base font-semibold leading-7">See my past work</p>
      <h1 class="mt-6 block max-w-5xl font-display text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight [text-wrap:balance] sm:text-6xl">Work</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8">Explore examples of professional WordPress websites, WooCommerce stores, and website optimisation projects delivering real results for businesses across Brighton and the UK.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-2xl auto-rows-fr grid-cols-1 gap-8 sm:mt-20 lg:mx-0 lg:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-3">
      {# First show featured projects #}
      {% for project in collections.portfolio %}
        {% if project.data.featured %}
          {% include "components/project-card.njk" %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
      {# Then show non-featured projects in reverse date order #}
      {% for project in collections.portfolio | reverse %}
        {% if not project.data.featured %}
          {% include "components/project-card.njk" %}
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
